|               |                     SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                       Projection: CAST(tbl.key AS Int64) AS id, tbl.answer, tbl.question, tbl.subject, tbl.data AS answer_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score                                                                |
|               |                         TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   Projection: base_table.id, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                     TableScan: base_table projection=[id, reference_answer, source]                                                                                                                                                     |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score,Int64(3))@2 as trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score,Int64(3))]                                           |
|               |   SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@3 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@3 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[id@3 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(_score@0, 3) as trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score,Int64(3)), _score@0 as _score]                                                                 |
|               |         SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@5 as _score, answer@1 as answer, answer_embedding@4 as answer_embedding, id@0 as id, question@2 as question, reference_answer@6 as reference_answer, source@7 as source, subject@3 as subject] |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@0)], projection=[id@0, answer@1, question@2, subject@3, answer_embedding@4, _score@5, reference_answer@7, source@8]      |
|               |                 CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@4 AS Int64) as id, answer@0 as answer, question@1 as question, subject@2 as subject, data@3 as answer_embedding, 1 - distance@5 as _score]                                             |
